#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.apply_chunk.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.apply\\_chunk"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:1 of
msgid "GroupBy.apply_chunk() -- per-group-chunk application."
msgstr "GroupBy.apply_chunk() -- 每组块应用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:3 of
msgid ""
"Applies ``func`` to each group's execution chunk independently.  As with "
"the ungrouped ``apply_chunk``, the row count and row order may change. "
"Hidden columns are not propagated (see ``groupby_apply`` for details)."
msgstr ""
"独立地将 ``func`` 应用于每个组的执行块。与未分组的 ``apply_chunk`` 一样，"
"行数和行顺序可能会改变。隐藏列不会传播（详情请参见 ``groupby_apply``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:7 of
msgid ""
"Function taking a per-group DataFrame chunk and returning a DataFrame (or"
" a tuple of DataFrames for multiple outputs).  If ``func`` is a class, it"
" is instantiated once per group, ``__call__(batch, end=True)`` is invoked"
" once with ``end=True`` (each call is a complete invocation that must "
"flush its output), and ``close()`` (if defined) is always called at the "
"end of each group."
msgstr ""
"接收每个组的 DataFrame 块并返回一个 DataFrame（或多个输出的 DataFrame "
"元组）的函数。如果 ``func`` 是一个类，则每个组实例化一次，在每次调用时"
"使用 ``end=True`` 调用 ``__call__(batch, end=True)``（每次调用都是必须"
"刷新其输出的完整调用），并且在每个组结束时总是调用 ``close()``（如果定义"
"的话）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:16 of
msgid "Expected output dtypes."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:18 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:20 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:22 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:24 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:26 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame whose materialized output is the per-group concatenation "
"of ``func`` results.  The row count may differ from the input.  Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"惰性 LiteFrame，其具体化的输出是 ``func`` 结果的按组连接。行数可能与输入"
"不同。调用 ``.execute()`` 进行具体化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:33 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:34 of
msgid "Apply a function to each group as a whole frame."
msgstr "将函数应用于每个组作为整个框架。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:36 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_transform_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply_chunk.groupby_apply_chunk:37 of
msgid "Per-group-chunk transform."
msgstr "按组块转换。"

